1
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,960
My first love, Mala.

2
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,560
All my joys and sorrows

3
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:46,039
were tied to his youth alone.

4
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:48,520
He was my only kindred spirit

5
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,440
and salvation.

6
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:52,680
But he suddenly disappeared ten years ago.

7
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,160
The cause of his death remains a mystery.

8
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,800
To this day, no one has found his body.

9
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:58,880
I brought you

10
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,680
everything you like.

11
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,040
You won't be lonely anymore.

12
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,520
When the whole world is starting to forget him.

13
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:13,720
I'm the only one who firmly believes he's still alive.

14
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,680
What ultimately killed Xiaofei

15
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:31,530
was the equal greed of humans and animals.

16
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:33,840
What about me?

17
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,880
What should my death be blamed on?

18
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,120
You won't be alone anymore.

19
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,060
Do you believe what I said now?

20
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,360
I don't know.

21
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:47,920
Xiaofei should be over ten years old.

22
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,160
Maybe when dogs reach a certain age...

23
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:51,160
What do you mean reach a certain age?

24
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,200
It's really dangerous here now.

25
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,320
I saw with my own eyes that I died at twelve o'clock.

26
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:58,680
And I couldn't find any of you in the villa.

27
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,680
What if the killer isn't targeting me,

28
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,600
but all of us?

29
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,530
You've arrived.

30
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:10,000
The island is sealed off.

31
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,000
And the mountain road is closed too.

32
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,360
Then it's a good thing you left early.

33
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,840
Otherwise you wouldn't have been able to get out.

34
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,720
Okay.

35
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:17,760
Alright.

36
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,440
Sure.

37
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,100
As long as you arrived safely.

38
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:28,140
What's wrong, bro?

39
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:41,040
If a murder can be solved before it happens,

40
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:44,079
this novel concept will definitely sell well.

41
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:48,290
But when you actually go from being the author to the victim,

42
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:51,160
all that's left is the panic of being unable to save yourself.

43
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,220
So what do we do now?

44
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,660
Who do you suspect?

45
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:57,100
I saw that cake with my own eyes at 12 o'clock.

46
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,840
Maybe the killer originally planned to use poison,

47
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:02,440
but Xiaofei ate the cake and took the hit for me,

48
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,760
so the killer switched to a steak knife.

49
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:07,680
Now we just need to see who had access to the cake and the knife,

50
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,400
and they would be the prime suspect.

51
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,280
Who would hate me so deeply

52
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,280
that they would want to kill me at all costs?

53
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,940
Those with the most access...

54
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:16,040
You mean...

55
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,760
But how could An'an harm you?

56
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:22,440
Sophie might have a weird temper,

57
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,560
but she wouldn't go that far.

58
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,760
You don't know An'an,

59
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,080
and you certainly don't know Sophie.

60
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,560
The only thing we can do now

61
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,730
is to find the motive for the murder

62
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,960
and eliminate it.

63
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,159
I'll help you.

64
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,530
What do you mean?

65
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,640
You're buying me a house?

66
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:56,120
Yes, that penthouse you like the most.

67
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:58,360
I agreed to Dai's conditions.

68
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,890
Once I win the Xinghe Award,

69
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,240
everything will get better.

70
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,160
Get better?

71
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,800
What else do you want,

72
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,200
or what do you want to do?

73
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,520
I'll help you figure it out.

74
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,600
I miss Xiaofei.

75
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,160
Can you bring it back to me?

76
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,440
Xiaofei is dead.

77
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,720
Why are you talking about a penthouse?

78
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,920
And why now?

79
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:23,040
Do you think this is hush money or a breakup fee?

80
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,520
What hush money or breakup fee?

81
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:26,120
Could it be that my dear nephew is back?

82
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,200
Your true love is back.

83
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,800
So you want to get back together with An'an?

84
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,520
An'an.

85
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,690
What do you think happened to Xiaofei?

86
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,800
It's a dog in its teens.

87
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,800
Probably because it's getting old,

88
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:39,450
it's just something that happens naturally.

89
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,280
So,

90
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:44,159
you still came back for Zhiwei, didn't you?

91
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:48,600
But,

92
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:51,200
I already know I've failed.

93
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,380
One has to admit their failure

94
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,659
in order to start over.

95
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,040
Why do you always bring up An'an?

96
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,600
That was a long time ago.

97
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,880
A long time ago?

98
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:03,420
Since she was little, what she was best at

99
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:07,480
was effortlessly taking away everything that should have been mine.

100
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,320
I know

101
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:11,770
that incident back then was a huge blow to both of you.

102
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,330
No one else would easily turn back either.

103
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,940
Can you really let it go

104
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,370
and stop hating Zhiwei?

105
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:26,640
Of course I hated him.

106
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:29,880
Because

107
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:31,920
we killed someone.

108
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,080
You said

109
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,000
you would never leave me,

110
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,159
right?

111
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,400
You're crazy.

112
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,840
I am crazy.

113
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:50,400
I never thought

114
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,320
that Mala's death

115
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:55,050
actually had something to do with you.

116
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,650
Only we know Mara's secret.

117
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,640
Back then, it was because...

118
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,380
Someone...

119
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,360
You were the one eavesdropping.

120
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:15,080
Why are you so obsessed with what happened to Mara?

121
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,240
Between men and dogs,

122
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,120
the biggest difference is

123
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,160
that Xiaofei won't lie to me.

124
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,440
But you,

125
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:26,880
from the first day we met,

126
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,400
you've been lying to me.

127
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:32,000
You never told me

128
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,120
that you knew Mala well,

129
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,080
did you?

130
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:42,080
That's my past. It has nothing to do with you.

131
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:44,920
If I tell them

132
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,920
that Mala's death is related to you,

133
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,560
do you think you can still get the Xinghe Award nomination?

134
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,320
Don't make trouble.

135
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,320
Don't talk nonsense.

136
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:51,640
Now you're scared.

137
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:52,880
To help you,

138
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,560
I would risk everything.

139
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:57,120
Don't think you can get rid of me with your lousy money.

140
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,280
I'm warning you.

141
00:07:58,400 --> 00:07:59,659
If you dare to betray me

142
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,340
and make up with An'an,

143
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:04,320
even your life won't be enough to pay for it.

144
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,640
I'm in control now.

145
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,250
If you don't want to die,

146
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,300
don't mess with me.

147
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,480
Just kidding.

148
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,280
It's all in the past.

149
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,919
Then do you

150
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:35,840
still love him?

151
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,679
You left so resolutely back then.

152
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:44,940
You didn't come back now just to get back together, did you?

153
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:48,920
I just want to know,

154
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,300
over the past three years,

155
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:53,840
how he's been doing.

156
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:58,240
How could he be so at peace with himself?

157
00:08:58,400 --> 00:09:00,660
Three years is enough to change a person.

158
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:04,610
Sometimes I understand Zhiwei less and less too.

159
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,060
For example, 'The Death of Marat'

160
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,800
used to be our joint work.

161
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,450
I have only loved two people in my life.

162
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:24,120
Whether it's the white rose or the red rose,

163
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:27,080
they both might want me dead.
